# {{.project_name}}

Composable workspace generated by smokeforge.

This workspace contains an optional API and any non-conflicting selection of web,
desktop, Android, and iOS clients. Only selected clients are present under
`apps/`.

## Layout

```text
apps/
  api/                 API, when selected
  web/                 Next.js client, when selected
  desktop/             Electron, egui, or GPUI client, when selected
  android/             Android Compose client, when selected
  ios/                 SwiftUI client, when selected
AGENTS.md              Agent routing for the selected clients
CLAUDE.md              Short agent entry point
CONTEXT-MAP.md         Client context map
Makefile               One entry point for install, test, CI, and clean
docs/                  Cross-client guidance
skills-lock.json       Workspace-level skill lock
```

## Commands

```bash
make install
make test
make ci
```

Use the client-specific commands listed below for local development.

